# PassHaven Configuration Reference

### Backend (.env in backend/)
# MONGODB_URI=mongodb+srv://<username>:<password>@cluster.mongodb.net/PassHaven?retryWrites=true&w=majority
# JWT_SECRET=your_jwt_secret_here
# ENCRYPTION_KEY=64_character_hex_string_here
# PORT=3000

### Frontend (.env in frontend/)
# VITE_BACKEND=http://localhost:3000

### Extension (.env in web_extension/, baked in at build time)
# VITE_BACKEND=http://localhost:3000
# VITE_WEB_APP_URL=http://localhost:5173
